        <p class="subtitle">A comprehensive study to address barriers and opportunities for inclusion.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="proposal-card">
            <h2>Project Overview</h2>
            <p>This research project aims to develop a holistic framework for improving the quality of life for individuals with disabilities. By analyzing current barriers and identifying innovative solutions, we seek to create a more inclusive society.</p>

            <div class="highlight-box">
                <strong>Key Focus Areas:</strong>
                <ul>
                    <li>Accessibility and Physical Environment</li>
                    <li>Adaptive Technology and Assistive Devices</li>
                    <li>Social Inclusion and Community Support</li>
                    <li>Psychological Well-being and Mental Health</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="proposal-card">
            <h2>Methodology</h2>
            <p>We will employ a mixed-methods approach combining quantitative surveys to measure current barriers and qualitative interviews to explore personal experiences. The data will be analyzed to identify trends and propose targeted interventions.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="proposal-card">
            <h2>Expected Outcomes</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>A comprehensive report detailing identified barriers and proposed solutions.</li>
                <li>A toolkit for community organizations and policymakers.</li>
                <li>Training modules for professionals in the disability sector.</li>
            </ul>
