                    <li>Conducting interviews with disability advocates and service providers.</li>
                    <li>Reviewing existing research and policy documents.</li>
                </ul>
            </p>
            <p>
                <strong>Phase 2: Data Collection & Analysis (Months 4-6)</strong>
                <ul>
                    <li>Administering surveys to target populations.</li>
                    <li>Analyzing survey data and qualitative transcripts.</li>
                </ul>
